flowchart TD
    A["|0⟩^⊗(number of qubits) initialization"] --> B["H^⊗(number of qubits) 적용"]
    B --> C["uniform superposition |ψ⟩\n= (1/√(number of states)) Σ|x⟩"]
    C --> D{"(π/4)√(number of states / number of solutions)\niterations를 돌았는가?"}
    D -->|"아직 (각 iteration)"| E["oracle U_f = I − 2Σ_{x∈A}|x⟩⟨x|\npredicate를 만족하는 칸의 sign 반전 (표시)"]
    E --> F["diffusion operator U_ψ = 2|ψ⟩⟨ψ| − I\ninversion about the mean (amplitude amplification)"]
    F --> D
    D -->|"완료"| G["computational basis measurement"]
    G --> H["predicate를 만족하는 칸\nprobability ≈ 1"]

    classDef init fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#5b8def,color:#173;
    classDef iter fill:#fff1ea,stroke:#e8663d,color:#333;
    classDef done fill:#eafbea,stroke:#3aa83a,color:#173;
    class A,B,C init;
    class E,F iter;
    class G,H done;
